              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo kabili abena Israeli bayaluluka, balaya no musebo walola ku Bashani. Kanshi Ogi imfumu ya ku Bashani ne fita fyaiko fyonse, yaya kukubakumanya mukubalwisha ku Edurei. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yawe aeba Mose ati, “Wimutiina Ogi. Pantu nimupeela mu minwe yobe, kumo kwine ne fita fyakwe fyonse pamo ne calo cakwe cine. Umucite filya wacitile Sihoni imfumu ya bena Amoli, uwaleteeka mu Heshiboni.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abena Israeli baipaya Ogi na bana bakwe abaume, ne fita fyakwe fyonse. Takwapuswike nangu umo. Elyo bapoka ne calo cakwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.35"
            ]
          }
        }
